cam></span> </span><span class=prompt-card__heading>Create an imaginative aerial landscape</span><span class=prompt-card__text> Aerial landscape in winter made from pink fur. </span></div></div></div><div class="marquee-carousel__slide js-marquee-card" aria-hidden=true><div class="prompt-card has-image has-extended-prompt has-modal prompt-card--yellow" data-event-content-name="Visualize photos as figurines" data-modal-extended-prompt="First ask me to upload an image and then create a 1/7 scale commercialized figurine of the characters in the picture, in a realistic style, in a real environment. The figurine is placed on a computer desk. The figurine has a round transparent acrylic base, with no text on the base. The content on the computer screen is a 3D modeling process of this figurine. Next to the computer screen is a toy packaging box, designed in a style reminiscent of high-quality collectible figures, printed with original artwork. The packaging features two-dimensional flat illustrations." data-gtm-event=prompt_wall_select data-modal-open=modal-overlay-0-visualize-photos-as-figurines data-target=/prompts/visualize-photos-as-figurines/><picture class="image --scrim prompt-card__background-image" aria-hidden=true><source sizes="(max-width: 768px) calc(100vw - 2rem), (max-width: 1440px) 90vw, 1440px" srcset="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/7hmizwaXzb8JR6KL70wbW2CsOwSxFGygC_hHgXC-YN8jJm1cjiNl82gL5faSsxIArzvapbcnpqmvGWpfymUqqAVtiYvyXP9uBXukGDeqKH-YgRS-pg=w393-rw-lo 393w, https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/7hmizwaXzb8JR6KL70wbW2CsOwSxFGygC_hHgXC-YN8jJm1cjiNl82gL5faSsxIArzvapbcnpqmvGWpfymUqqAVtiYvyXP9uBXukGDeqKH-YgRS-pg=w480-rw-lo 480w, https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/7hmizwaXzb8JR6KL70wbW2CsOwSxFGygC_hHgXC-YN8jJm1cjiNl82gL5faSsxIArzvapbcnpqmvGWpfymUqqAVtiYvyXP9uBXukGDeqKH-YgRS-pg=w640-rw-lo 640w, https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/7hmizwaXzb8JR6KL70wbW2CsOwSxFGygC_hHgXC-YN8jJm1cjiNl82gL5faSsxIArzvapbcnpqmvGWpfymUqqAVtiYvyXP9uBXukGDeqKH-YgRS-pg=w768-rw-lo 768w, https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/7hmizwaXzb8JR6KL70wbW2CsOwSxFGygC_hHgXC-YN8jJm1cjiNl82gL5faSsxIArzvapbcnpqmvGWpfymUqqAVtiYvyXP9uBXukGDeqKH-YgRS-pg=w1024-rw-lo 1024w, https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/7hmizwaXzb8JR6KL70wbW2CsOwSxFGygC_hHgXC-YN8jJm1cjiNl82gL5faSsxIArzvapbcnpqmvGWpfymUqqAVtiYvyXP9uBXukGDeqKH-YgRS-pg=w1440-rw-lo 1440w, https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/7hmizwaXzb8JR6KL70wbW2CsOwSxFGygC_hHgXC-YN8jJm1cjiNl82gL5faSsxIArzvapbcnpqmvGWpfymUqqAVtiYvyXP9uBXukGDeqKH-YgRS-pg=w1728-rw-lo 1728w, https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/7hmizwaXzb8JR6KL70wbW2CsOwSxFGygC_hHgXC-YN8jJm1cjiNl82gL5faSsxIArzvapbcnpqmvGWpfymUqqAVtiYvyXP9uBXukGDeqKH-YgRS-pg=w2880-rw-lo 2355w" type=image/webp><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/7hmizwaXzb8JR6KL70wbW2CsOwSxFGygC_hHgXC-YN8jJm1cjiNl82gL5faSsxIArzvapbcnpqmvGWpfymUqqAVtiYvyXP9uBXukGDeqKH-YgRS-pg=w1440" alt class=picture__image height=1037 loading=lazy role=presentation width=1440></picture><div class=prompt-card__content><span class="prompt-icon prompt-card__icon"> <span class=icon-md-outlined data-icon=guardian></span> </span><span class=prompt-card__heading>Visualize photos as figurines</span><span class=prompt-card__text> First ask me to upload an image and then create a 1/7 scale commercialized figurine of the characters in the picture, in a realistic style, in a real environment. The figurine is placed on a computer desk. The figurine has a round transparent acrylic base, with no text on the base. The content on the computer screen is a 3D modeling process of this figurine. Next to the computer screen is a toy packaging box, designed in a style reminiscent of high-quality collectible figures, printed with original artwork. The packaging features two-dimensional flat illustrations. </span></div></div></div><div class="marquee-carousel__slide js-marquee-card" aria-hidden=true><div class="prompt-card has-image has-extended-prompt has-modal prompt-card--yellow" data-event-content-name="Envision a mural" data-modal-extended-prompt="First ask me to upload a photo of my wall. Then generate an image of what it would look like with a modern mural painted on it. The design should maintain some white space, but be a little unconventional and playful, with striking patterns and unique color combinations" data-gtm-event=prompt_wall_select data-modal-open=modal-overlay-0-envision-a-mural data-target=/prompts/envision-a-mural/><picture class="image --scrim prompt-card__background-image" aria-hidden=true><source sizes="(max-width: 768px) calc(100vw - 2rem), (max-width: 1440px) 90vw, 1440px" srcset="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/YdjbvZW4nASBShyS11kDTb58DPPJEK-5YbvPd4gT9zGeKwe5DkADmIvw3CKUGUXX1LEMZ__G95gyhjR37yeOlesQv05bYJ8mZfhyWfQOyrmXbcWrp3Q=w393-rw-lo 393w, https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/YdjbvZW4nASBShyS11kDTb58DPPJEK-5YbvPd4gT9zGeKwe5DkADmIvw3CKUGUXX1LEMZ__G95gyhjR37yeOlesQv05bYJ8mZfhyWfQOyrmXbcWrp3Q=w480-rw-lo 480w, https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/YdjbvZW4nASBShyS11kDTb58DPPJEK-5YbvPd4gT9zGeKwe5DkADmIvw3CKUGUXX1LEMZ__G95gyhjR37yeOlesQv05bYJ8mZfhyWfQOyrmXbcWrp3Q=w640-rw-lo 640w, https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/YdjbvZW4nASBShyS11kDTb58DPPJEK-5YbvPd4gT9zGeKwe5DkADmIvw3CKUGUXX1LEMZ__G95gyhjR37yeOlesQv05bYJ8mZfhyWfQOyrmXbcWrp3Q=w768-rw-lo 768w, https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/YdjbvZW4nASBShyS11kDTb58DPPJEK-5YbvPd4gT9zGeKwe5DkADmIvw3CKUGUXX1LEMZ__G95gyhjR37yeOlesQv05bYJ8mZfhyWfQOyrmXbcWrp3Q=w1024-rw-lo 1024w, https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/YdjbvZW4nASBShyS11kDTb58DPPJEK-5YbvPd4gT9zGeKwe5DkADmIvw3CKUGUXX1LEMZ__G95gyhjR37yeOlesQv05bYJ8mZfhyWfQOyrmXbcWrp3Q=w1440-rw-lo 1440w, https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/YdjbvZW4nASBShyS11kDTb58DPPJEK-5YbvPd4gT9zGeKwe5DkADmIvw3CKUGUXX1LEMZ__G95gyhjR37yeOlesQv05bYJ8mZfhyWfQOyrmXbcWrp3Q=w1728-rw-lo 1728w, https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/YdjbvZW4nASBShyS11kDTb58DPPJEK-5YbvPd4gT9zGeKwe5DkADmIvw3CKUGUXX1LEMZ__G95gyhjR37yeOlesQv05bYJ8mZfhyWfQOyrmXbcWrp3Q=w2880-rw-lo 2200w" type=image/webp><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/YdjbvZW4nASBShyS11kDTb58D