y (to match voice): His mouth movements should be subtle, syncing believably with the human speech.' data-gtm-event=prompt_wall_select data-modal-open=modal-overlay-1-create-vertical-videos data-target=/prompts/create-vertical-videos/><picture class="image --scrim prompt-card__background-image" aria-hidden=true><source sizes="(max-width: 768px) calc(100vw - 2rem), (max-width: 1440px) 90vw, 1440px" srcset="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/8VXPEnZQZjHxslqFE8mUroSsz-9VwvXlGhdzhR_b5jcpX-Ftl56GVw9Yw7wB3lLsCfRBMdS5wAFRRsT2CriBs8YDcQs2lS7zndKg-EIjEyeMbPpfLQ=w393-rw-lo 393w, https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/8VXPEnZQZjHxslqFE8mUroSsz-9VwvXlGhdzhR_b5jcpX-Ftl56GVw9Yw7wB3lLsCfRBMdS5wAFRRsT2CriBs8YDcQs2lS7zndKg-EIjEyeMbPpfLQ=w480-rw-lo 480w, https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/8VXPEnZQZjHxslqFE8mUroSsz-9VwvXlGhdzhR_b5jcpX-Ftl56GVw9Yw7wB3lLsCfRBMdS5wAFRRsT2CriBs8YDcQs2lS7zndKg-EIjEyeMbPpfLQ=w640-rw-lo 640w, https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/8VXPEnZQZjHxslqFE8mUroSsz-9VwvXlGhdzhR_b5jcpX-Ftl56GVw9Yw7wB3lLsCfRBMdS5wAFRRsT2CriBs8YDcQs2lS7zndKg-EIjEyeMbPpfLQ=w768-rw-lo 768w, https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/8VXPEnZQZjHxslqFE8mUroSsz-9VwvXlGhdzhR_b5jcpX-Ftl56GVw9Yw7wB3lLsCfRBMdS5wAFRRsT2CriBs8YDcQs2lS7zndKg-EIjEyeMbPpfLQ=w1024-rw-lo 1024w, https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/8VXPEnZQZjHxslqFE8mUroSsz-9VwvXlGhdzhR_b5jcpX-Ftl56GVw9Yw7wB3lLsCfRBMdS5wAFRRsT2CriBs8YDcQs2lS7zndKg-EIjEyeMbPpfLQ=w1440-rw-lo 1440w, https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/8VXPEnZQZjHxslqFE8mUroSsz-9VwvXlGhdzhR_b5jcpX-Ftl56GVw9Yw7wB3lLsCfRBMdS5wAFRRsT2CriBs8YDcQs2lS7zndKg-EIjEyeMbPpfLQ=w1728-rw-lo 1728w, https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/8VXPEnZQZjHxslqFE8mUroSsz-9VwvXlGhdzhR_b5jcpX-Ftl56GVw9Yw7wB3lLsCfRBMdS5wAFRRsT2CriBs8YDcQs2lS7zndKg-EIjEyeMbPpfLQ=w2880-rw-lo 2200w" type=image/webp><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/8VXPEnZQZjHxslqFE8mUroSsz-9VwvXlGhdzhR_b5jcpX-Ftl56GVw9Yw7wB3lLsCfRBMdS5wAFRRsT2CriBs8YDcQs2lS7zndKg-EIjEyeMbPpfLQ=w1440" alt class=picture__image height=1036 loading=lazy role=presentation width