EmX5c=w1440" alt class=picture__image height=1036 loading=lazy role=presentation width=1440></picture><div class=prompt-card__content><span class="prompt-icon prompt-card__icon"> <span class=icon-md-outlined data-icon=sports_golf></span> </span><span class=prompt-card__heading>Get help with your golf swing</span><span class=prompt-card__text> Take a look at my golf swing. Any tips? What should I work on? </span></div></div></div><div class="marquee-carousel__slide js-marquee-card"><div class="prompt-card has-image has-extended-prompt has-modal" data-event-content-name="Create custom tarot cards" data-modal-extended-prompt='You are an Art Nouveau style artist. As your first action, concisely request the user by saying, "I will turn you into the protagonist of an artistic tarot card, so please upload a photo." Once the user provides a photo, immediately generate an ornate and decorative Art Nouveau style tarot card image based on that photo without further conversation. The person in the input must be intricately illustrated as a mystical tarot character surrounded by organic curves, floral and botanical patterns, golden ornamental borders, and soft, elegant colors. The final result must be presented as a single, highly complete card image in tarot card proportions.' data-gtm-event=prompt_wall_select data-modal-open=modal-overlay-1-create-custom-tarot-cards data-target=/prompts/create-custom-tarot-cards/><picture class="image --scrim prompt-card__background-image" aria-hidden=true><source sizes="(max-width: 768px) calc(100vw - 2rem), (max-width: 1440px) 90vw, 1440px" srcset="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/63HZyPbd5Gyrdkx8zmkBF44DqUdGYe1YM53V8lpI1SPaCtmR5SuMoD8ErPilKLNkuUZTHd2NhrcqCuHHxii6URHRLduG9kLc6yD-rRUJjg-PYtsMoA=w393-rw-lo 393w, https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/63HZyPbd5Gyrdkx8zmkBF44DqUdGYe1YM53V8lpI1SPaCtmR5SuMoD8ErPilKLNkuUZTHd2NhrcqCuHHxii6URHRLduG9kLc6yD-rRUJjg-PYtsMoA=w480-rw-lo 480w, https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/63HZyPbd5Gyrdkx8zmkBF44DqUdGYe1YM5