 generate an ornate and decorative Art Nouveau style tarot card image based on that photo without further conversation. The person in the input must be intricately illustrated as a mystical tarot character surrounded by organic curves, floral and botanical patterns, golden ornamental borders, and soft, elegant colors. The final result must be presented as a single, highly complete card image in tarot card proportions. </span></div></div></div><div class="marquee-carousel__slide js-marquee-card" aria-hidden=true><div class="prompt-card has-image has-extended-prompt has-modal prompt-card--blue" data-event-content-name="Transform a sketch into a realistic image" data-modal-extended-prompt="Transform the simple sketch into a realistic car, follow creative direction of the sketch and use the colors and texture from the uploaded image" data-gtm-event=prompt_wall_select data-modal-open=modal-overlay-1-transform-a-sketch-into-a-realistic-image data-target=/prompts/transform-a-sketch-into-a-realistic-image/><picture class="image --scrim prompt-card__background-image" aria-hidden=true><source sizes="(max-width: 768px) calc(100vw - 2rem), (max-width: 1440px) 90vw, 1440px" srcset="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/6NjnWQ4ibA2obh_K5d1k2Rcwbqjxe-HC4DkEGi-bYItS1xesr-bTmjlBq5AzYemxxe3t6d0-Xdg7gymzE7BnoUstADSlBlvqbJj5OgzaJTUGNTIbMQ=w393-rw-lo 393w, https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/6NjnWQ4ibA2obh_K5d1k2Rcwbqjxe-HC4DkEGi-bYItS1xesr-bTmjlBq5AzYemxxe3t6d0-Xdg7gymzE7BnoUstADSlBlvqbJj5OgzaJTUGNTIbMQ=w480-rw-lo 480w, https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/6NjnWQ4ibA2obh_K5d1k2Rcwbqjxe-HC4DkEGi-bYItS1xesr-bTmjlBq5AzYemxxe3t6d0-Xdg7gymzE7BnoUstADSlBlvqbJj5OgzaJTUGNTIbMQ=w640-rw-lo 550w" type=image/webp><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/6NjnWQ4ibA2obh_K5d1k2Rcwbqjxe-HC4DkEGi-bYItS1xesr-bTmjlBq5AzYemxxe3t6d0-Xdg7gymzE7BnoUstADSlBlvqbJj5OgzaJTUGNTIbMQ=w1440" alt class=picture__image height=396 loading=lazy role=presentation width=550></picture><div class=prompt-card__content><span class="prompt-icon prompt-card__icon"> <span class=icon-md-outlined data-icon=draw></span> </span><span class=prompt-card__heading>Transform a sketch into a realistic image</span><span class=prompt-card__text> Transform the simple sketch into a realistic car, follow creative direction of the sketch and use the colors and texture from the uploaded image </span></div></div></div><div class="marquee-carousel__slide js-marquee-card" aria-hidden=true><div class="prompt-card has-image has-extended-prompt has-modal" data-event-content-name="Turn a photo into poetry" data-modal-extended-prompt="First ask me to upload an image. Then write a poem about it." data-gtm-event=prompt_wall_select data-modal-open=modal-overlay-1-turn-a-photo-into-poetry data-target=/prompts/turn-a-photo-into-poetry/><picture class="image --scrim prompt-card__background-image" aria-hidden=true><source sizes="(max-width: 768px) calc(100vw - 2rem), (max-width: 1440px) 90vw, 1440px" srcset="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/rQ9XgGFqXoCj_nokt3Tf_8H-w4-E8-PQv3BSd-iSehiHU80TG3r_IvnIpD7rjWiqSwu4VDUCTXxcrQ6zQhd1D9PVmNRyryyJERXndbFeokGGx0lFYBg=w393-rw-lo 393w, https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/rQ9XgGFqXoCj_nokt3Tf_8H-w4-E8-PQv3BSd-iSehiHU80TG3r_IvnIpD7rjWiqSwu4VDUCTXxcrQ6zQhd1D9PVmNRyryyJERXndbFeokGGx0lFYBg=w480-rw-lo 480w, https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/rQ9XgGFqXoCj_nokt3Tf_8H-w4-E8-PQv3BSd-iSehiHU80TG3r_IvnIpD7rjWiqSwu4VDUCTXxcrQ6zQhd1D9PVmNRyryyJERXndbFeokGGx0lFYBg=w640-rw-lo 640w, https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/rQ9XgGFqXoCj_nokt3Tf_8H-w4-E8-PQv3BSd-iSehiHU80TG3r_IvnIpD7rjWiqSwu4VDUCTXxcrQ6zQhd1D9PVmNRyryyJERXndbFeokGGx0lFYBg=w768-rw-lo 768w, https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/rQ9XgGFqXoCj_nokt3Tf_8H-w4-E8-PQv3BSd-iSehiHU80TG3r_IvnIpD7rjWiqSwu4VDUCTXxcrQ6zQhd1D9PVmNRyryyJERXndbFeokGGx0lFYBg=w1024-rw-lo 1024w, https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/rQ9XgGFqXoCj_nokt3Tf_8H-w4-E8-PQv3BSd-iSehiHU80TG3r_IvnIpD7rjWiqSwu4VDUCTXxcrQ6zQhd1D9PVmNRyryyJERXndbFeokGGx0lFYBg=w1440-rw-lo 1440w, https://lh3.googleusercontent.com